  "description": "Font discovery, OpenType parsing (TrueType, CFF, collections, embedded and obfuscated fonts), metric-compatible substitution that reports what it substituted, Office-compatible text measurement and built-in Arabic and Hebrew shaping for DocWright. Bundles SIL OFL fallback faces (Carlito, Caladea, Liberation, Noto Naskh Arabic, STIX Two Math, Symbol and Wingdings stand-ins) so output stays usable on a machine with no fonts installed. Installed automatically by DocWright, DocWright.Spreadsheet.Rendering and DocWright.Reporting.",
